            "meaning": "轿车"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s3",
      "role": "Man",
      "text": "After a great many loud explosions, the race began.",
      "translation": "在一阵巨响后，比赛开始了。",
      "startTime": 50.17,
      "endTime": 56.1,
      "analysis": {
        "words": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s4",
      "role": "Woman",
      "text": "Many of the cars broke down on the course and some drivers spent more time under their cars than in them!",
      "translation": "许多汽车在途中抛锚了，有些司机在车底下待的时间比在车里待的时间还长！",
      "startTime": 56.11,
      "endTime": 65.85,
      "analysis": {
        "words": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s5",
      "role": "Man",
      "text": "A few cars, however, completed the race.",
      "translation": "然而，有几辆汽车完成了比赛。",
      "startTime": 65.86,
      "endTime": 69.69,
      "analysis": {
        "words": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s6",
      "role": "Woman",
      "text": "The winning car reached a speed of forty miles an hour -- much faster than any of its rivals.",
      "translation": "获胜的那辆车达到了每小时40英里的速度——比其他任何车都快得多。",
      "startTime": 69.7,
      "endTime": 78.46,
      "analysis": {
